{"lang":"en","textes":{"interface":{"la précédente édition":"the previous edition","L'édition de tous les records":"The record-breaking edition","Se replonger dans la 12e édition":"Rediscover the 12th edition","Voir la cartographie":"View the map","Dans un nouvel onglet":"In a new tab","Consulter et télécharger le classement":"View and download the ranking","Classement complet":"Full ranking","Date d’arrivée":"Arrival date","Heure d’arrivée":"Arrival time","Temps de course":"Race time","Actualités":"News","Les actualités fortes de 2022":"Key news stories of 2022","Édition 2022":"2022 Edition","Voir toutes les archives 2022":"See all the 2022 archives","À la une":"Featured","ACTUALITÉS":"NEWS","VIDÉO":"VIDEO","Voir l'after movie officiel":"Watch the official after movie","La vidéo est hébergée par YouTube":"This video is hosted on YouTube","Elle ne se charge pas tant que les cookies marketing sont refusés, pour que rien ne parte chez un tiers sans votre accord.":"It will not load while marketing cookies are declined, so that nothing is sent to a third party without your consent.","Gérer mes cookies":"Manage my cookies","Regarder sur YouTube":"Watch on YouTube","Les plus belles photos":"The most beautiful photos","Replier la galerie":"Show fewer photos","Classes":"Classes","Fermer":"Close","Photo précédente":"Previous photo","Photo suivante":"Next photo","Lire le film officiel de la Route du Rhum 2022":"Play the official Route du Rhum 2022 film","Film officiel de la Route du Rhum 2022":"Official Route du Rhum 2022 film","Cartographie de la Route du Rhum 2022":"Route du Rhum 2022 race map","La cartographie de la course 2022, la flotte entre Saint-Malo et la Guadeloupe":"The 2022 race map, the fleet between Saint-Malo and Guadeloupe","Un skipper brandit des fumigènes à son arrivée, de nuit":"A skipper holds up flares on arrival, at night"},"motifs":{"Voir les {n} autres photos":"See the {n} other photos","Agrandir : {x}":"Enlarge: {x}","{x}, places 4 à {n}":"{x}, places 4 to {n}","{x} à l’arrivée":"{x} at the finish"}},"cms":{"classes":{"Multi50":{"couleur":"","icone":""},"Vintage Multi":{"couleur":"#F19F39","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_6fb9d978d818431d972683d9c9ec59e9.svg"},"Vintage Mono":{"couleur":"#F9F06E","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_930cd1ca8140441297eb2221f84c2527.svg"},"Class40":{"couleur":"#7E93EF","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_18d3a763c5c349a396ea319e3efa0813.svg"},"Ocean Fifty":{"couleur":"#72B9F1","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_902e9f92f5364d5080bd02a40c37439a.svg"},"IMOCA":{"couleur":"#76BCBE","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_88d5eacce8234064ab797a04828d4b98.svg"},"Ultim":{"couleur":"#649FBF","icone":"https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/7bb303_0949a56bab9143a884ba94b852c18785.svg"}}},"releve":{"records":["The 12th edition of the Route du Rhum - Destination Guadeloupe promised to be exceptional; it exceeded all expectations. With 138 skippers at the starting line, the largest fleet ever assembled for a solo ocean race, the 2022 edition will remain one of the most memorable chapters in the history of this legendary transatlantic race. Strategic battles at every level, demanding conditions in the North Atlantic in November, and top-level performances made for an intense and unpredictable race.","Of the 138 sailors involved, 103 managed to reach Pointe-à-Pitre, illustrating the difficulty and selectivity of the event.","Beyond the sporting spectacle, this edition confirmed the vitality and excellence of all the classes, reinforcing the unique character of the Route du Rhum - Destination Guadeloupe. On land, the public success was just as remarkable: the 70,000 m² village of Saint-Malo welcomed huge crowds who came to admire the fleet, enjoy the entertainment, and share in the excitement of the departures.","The event also highlighted environmental issues, reinforcing its role as a platform for raising awareness about the ocean. Combining sporting performance, popular enthusiasm, and commitment, the Route du Rhum - Destination Guadeloupe 2022 has established itself as a benchmark edition and opens new perspectives for the future of the race."]},"selection":[{"t":"2022: The results of an exceptional edition!","d":"2023-04-03T22:00:00.000Z","u":"/post/2022-the-results-of-an-exceptional-edition","c":"547c0f_20bc3345f7d94608917f72ccbddbe471~mv2.png","l":1012,"h":490,"k":"actualites","m":5,"e":""},{"t":"📸 The most beautiful photos from the start: Route du Rhum 2022","d":"2022-11-09T11:09:49.217Z","u":"/post/the-most-beautiful-photos-from-the-start-route-du-rhum-2022","c":"547c0f_5a1b5c39d8494d42b39fca386eb7c486~mv2.webp","l":4069,"h":5425,"k":"image","m":1,"e":"Photo album of the start of the 2022 Route du Rhum race, by Ewan Lebourdais, official photographer of the French Navy."},{"t":"🔴 LIVE: The Finish of the Route du Rhum 2022","d":"2022-11-15T23:00:00.000Z","u":"/post/live-the-finish-of-the-route-du-rhum-2022","c":"547c0f_bf8217d3889b4fa5acf50a142de55b9d~mv2.png","l":486,"h":357,"k":"video","m":0,"e":"Live coverage of the arrival of the first competitors in the 2022 Route du Rhum race"},{"t":"Thomas Ruyant: “The most beautiful victory”","d":"2022-11-20T23:00:00.000Z","u":"/post/thomas-ruyant-the-most-beautiful-victory","c":"547c0f_3777afcbd6f347f28059f42535c2601b~mv2.jpg","l":1800,"h":1200,"k":"actualites","m":2,"e":"Breathless, exhausted, and emotional, Thomas Ruyant rocked the pontoon in front of the Macte in Point-à-Pitre. The LinkedOut skipper recounts his committed race, his immense desire to win, and his love for the sport of ocean racing."},{"t":"Yoann Richomme: \"hard, ungrateful but brilliant!\"","d":"2022-11-22T23:00:00.000Z","u":"/post/yoann-richomme-hard-ungrateful-but-brilliant","c":"547c0f_942fababa86a417aa212b251decde13b~mv2.jpg","l":1279,"h":853,"k":"actualites","m":3,"e":"The Class40 winner burst into joy upon arrival in Pointe-à-Pitre. Despite his fatigue, the two-time winner displayed astonishing lucidity as he spoke about the pace of the race, the fleet's commitment, and this adventure, which serves as a launching pad before the launch of the IMOCA Paprec Arkéa at the beginning of next year."},{"t":"Jean-Pierre Dick: “I am very proud to have put my name on the tablets of this edition”","d":"2022-11-25T23:00:00.000Z","u":"/post/jean-pierre-dick-i-am-very-proud-to-have-put-my-name-on-the-tablets-of-this-edition","c":"547c0f_7647424ecc1842fa9d919515da272932~mv2.jpg","l":600,"h":400,"k":"actualites","m":3,"e":"Considered by many to be the double-handed specialist, Jean-Pierre Dick (Notre Méditerranée - Ville de Nice) won his first major solo ocean race last night in the Rhum Mono category in style."}],"archives":"/medias-actualites?themes=2022%20edition","classement":[{"id":"ultim","nom":"Ultim","etiquette":"Ultim 32/23","cms":"Ultim","podium":[{"rang":1,"prenom":"Charles","nom":"CAUDRELIER","bateau":"Maxi Edmond de Rothschild","date":"16/11/2022","heure":"10:02","temps":"6 days, 19 hours, 47 minutes and 25 seconds","photo":"7bb303_ee389d9798e44c07835acd3b32332554~mv2.webp","portrait":true,"u":"https://www.routedurhum.com/post/charles-caudrelier-maxi-edmond-de-rothschild-remporte-la-route-du-rhum-destination-guadeloupe"},{"rang":2,"prenom":"François","nom":"GABART","bateau":"SVR-LAZARTIGUE","date":"16/11/2022","heure":"13:18","temps":"6 days, 23 hours, 3 minutes and 15 seconds","photo":"7bb303_4f876d8070e14fe3a342f26fe5c022f0~mv2.webp","portrait":true,"u":"https://www.routedurhum.com/post/flash-arrivée-françois-gabart-svr-lazartigue-deuxième-de-la-route-du-rhum-destination-guade"},{"rang":3,"prenom":"Thomas","nom":"COVILLE","bateau":"Sodebo Ultim 3","date":"16/11/2022","heure":"20:52","temps":"7 days, 6 hours, 37 minutes and 25 seconds","photo":"7bb303_bf7a44836f9e4673a0b7e1b70ac25b10~mv2.webp","portrait":true,"u":"https://www.routedurhum.com/post/flash-arrivée-thomas-coville-sodebo-ultim-3-troisième-de-la-route-du-rhum-des